          "short": "$(-10,\\infty)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2x&<30+5x\\\\-3x&<30\\\\x&>-10\\end{align*}$$\nDividing by $-3$ reverses the inequality. The solution is $(-10,\\infty)$.",
